        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For  $ u = (a, b) \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n+1} $,  $ \\|u\\|^2 = \\|a\\|^2 + b^2 = 1 $, we have",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                286,
